{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43531","headline":"三言重拟五杂组联句 · 颜真卿","name":"三言重拟五杂组联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五杂组，四豪客。\n往复还，阡与陌。\n不得已，长沙谪。\n五杂组，五辛盘。\n往复还，马上鞍。\n不得已，左降官。\n五杂组，甘咸醋。\n往复还，乌与兔。\n不得已，韶光度。\n五杂组，五色丝。\n往复还，回文诗。\n不得已，失喜期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"颜真卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43531.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43531","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}